#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:120
msgid "Selectable pricelists"
msgstr "Valgbare prislister"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:122
msgid ""
"Selectable pricelists are useful, for example, when selling products "
"in :doc:`multiple currencies <../../../sales/sales/products_prices/prices/"
"currencies>`, and allow customers to choose a pricelist using the pricelist "
"selector in the catalog, located next to the :ref:`search bar <ecommerce/"
"catalog/toolbar-and-filters>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:None
msgid "Pricelist selector on the e-commerce."
msgstr "Prislistevælger på webshoppen."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:130
msgid "To make a pricelist selectable, enable :guilabel:`Selectable`."
msgstr "For at gøre en prisliste valgbar skal du aktivere :guilabel:`Valgbar`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:133
msgid ""
"If a pricelist is designated as :guilabel:`Selectable` and not assigned to a "
"specific website, it is selectable on **all** websites."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:135
msgid ""
"If a pricelist does *not* appear in the selector, it may be due to the "
"following situations:"
msgstr ""
"Hvis en prisliste *ikke* vises i vælgeren, kan det skyldes følgende "
"situationer:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:137
msgid ""
"Only one pricelist is defined as :guilabel:`Selectable`, and "
"the :ref:`contact has a pricelist assigned <sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-"
"application>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:139
msgid ""
"Multiple selectable pricelists exist, but only those matching the "
"customer's :ref:`country group <ecommerce/prices/country-groups>` are shown. "
"It is strongly recommended to disable the :guilabel:`Selectable` option when "
"using pricelists with country groups on the e-commerce."
msgstr ""
"Der findes flere valgbare prislister, men kun dem, der matcher "
"kundens :ref:`landegruppe <ecommerce/prices/country-groups>`, vises. Det "
"anbefales stærkt at deaktivere indstillingen :guilabel:`Valgbar`, når du "
"bruger prislister med landegrupper på webshoppen."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:145
msgid ":ref:`sales/products/currencies/currency-specific-pricelists`"
msgstr ":ref:`sales/products/currencies/currency-specific-pricelists`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:150
msgid "GeoIP & country groups"
msgstr "GeoIP og landegrupper"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:152
msgid ""
"It is possible to display a specific pricelist based on the visitor's "
"location and IP address by assigning :ref:`country groups <ecommerce/prices/"
"country-groups>` to pricelists."
msgstr ""
"Det er muligt at vise en specifik prisliste baseret på besøgendes placering "
"og IP-adresse ved at tildele :ref:`landegrupper <ecommerce/prices/country-"
"groups>` til prislister."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:157
msgid ""
"To do so, :ref:`navigate to the relevant pricelist form <ecommerce/prices/"
"pricelists>` and select the appropriate :guilabel:`Country Groups`. Create "
"or edit as many pricelists for specific regions as needed. For instance, "
"select :guilabel:`European Union` to apply the pricelist to all EU member "
"states."
msgstr ""
"For at gøre dette skal du :ref:`navigere til den relevante prislisteformular "
"<ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` og vælge de "
"passende :guilabel:`Landegrupper`. Opret eller rediger så mange prislister "
"for specifikke regioner som nødvendigt. Vælg f.eks. :guilabel:`Den "
"Europæiske Union` for at anvende prislisten på alle EU-medlemslande."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:162
msgid ""
"To create a new country group, click :guilabel:`Search more` in the drop-"
"down list, then :guilabel:`Create New`. Add a :guilabel:`Group Name` and "
"select the relevant :guilabel:`Countries`. Use :ref:`Custom filters <search/"
"custom-filters>` if needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:167
msgid "Each country group must contain at least one country."
msgstr "Hver landegruppe skal indeholde mindst ét land."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:170
msgid ""
"Use the following filter to add all non-EU countries to the country group."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:172
msgid "`Country Groups` + `is not equal to` + `European Union`"
msgstr "`Landegrupper` + `er ikke lig med` + `Den Europæiske Union`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:0
msgid "Filter for country group creation."
msgstr "Filter til oprettelse af landegruppe."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:178
msgid ""
"When using GeoIP to determine the appropriate pricelist, **all** pricelists "
"used on the e-commerce site must have a country group assigned."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:180
msgid ""
"It is strongly recommended to disable the :guilabel:`Selectable` option when "
"using pricelists with country groups. Indeed, all pricelists with the "
"relevant country group are automatically applied to the catalog, but if one "
"of them is marked as :ref:`Selectable <ecommerce/prices/selectable-"
"pricelists>`, the others will disappear as soon as customers select the "
"selectable pricelist."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:187
msgid "Imagine you create three pricelists:"
msgstr "Forestil dig, at du opretter tre prislister:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:189
msgid "`EU regular prices` with the `EU` country group assigned"
msgstr "`EU almindelige priser` med landegruppen `EU` tildelt"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:190
msgid "`EU prices with discounts` with the `EU` country group assigned"
msgstr "`EU-priser med rabatter` med landegruppen `EU` tildelt"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:191
msgid "`US prices` with the `US` country group assigned"
msgstr "`US-priser` med landegruppen `US` tildelt"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:193
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Selectable` option is enabled for `EU regular prices` and "
"`US prices`, and the customer is from the European Union, only the "
"pricelists `EU regular prices` and `EU prices with discounts` will be "
"available. However, since the `EU prices with discount` list is not "
"selectable, it will disappear once the customer selects the `EU regular "
"prices` list, and prices will be displayed based on the `EU regular prices` "
"pricelist in the catalog."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:200
msgid "Pricelist application"
msgstr "Anvendelse af prisliste"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:202
msgid ""
"On the e-commerce, the *default* pricelist is automatically selected for "
"public, non-logged-in users when no country group is assigned. "
"If :ref:`GeoIP and country groups <ecommerce/prices/geoip>` are used, public "
"users see the pricelist of their country group by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:206
msgid ""
":ref:`Logged-in users <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-access>` "
"with :ref:`assigned pricelists <sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-"
"application>` see the assigned pricelist by default **if it is assigned to "
"the website** they are visiting. If not, the website's default pricelist is "
"applied (i.e., the first available pricelist assigned to the website and "
"without a country group, following the sequence order)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:212
msgid ""
"Assigned pricelists take precedence over country-based pricelists, when "
"applicable, unless the assigned pricelist is linked to a different country "
"group."
msgstr ""
"Tildelte prislister har forrang frem for landebaserede prislister, når det "
"er relevant, medmindre den tildelte prisliste er knyttet til en anden "
"landegruppe."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:216
msgid ""
"A customer from the United States visits the website. They do not have a "
"portal account. The :guilabel:`United States` pricelist is applied."
msgstr ""
"En kunde fra USA besøger hjemmesiden. De har ikke en "
"portalkonto. :guilabel:`United States` prislisten anvendes."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:219
msgid ""
"A different visitor, also from the United States, has the :guilabel:`Loyal "
"Customer Discount` pricelist assigned in their contact form. This assignment "
"takes precedence over the country group assignment, so the :guilabel:`Loyal "
"Customer Discount` is applied."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:0
msgid "An example of various pricelists assigned to a website."
msgstr "Et eksempel på forskellige prislister tildelt en hjemmeside."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:230
msgid "Discounts"
msgstr "Rabatter"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:235
msgid "Discounts programs"
msgstr "Rabatprogrammer"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:237
msgid ""
"To enable :doc:`discount programs </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/"
"loyalty_discount>` for your e-commerce, go to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` "
"section, and enable the :guilabel:`Discounts, Loyalty & Gift Card` feature."
msgstr ""
"For at aktivere :doc:`rabatprogrammer </applications/sales/sales/"
"products_prices/loyalty_discount>` til din webshop skal du gå "
"til :menuselection:`Hjemmeside --> Konfiguration --> Indstillinger`, rulle "
"ned til sektionen :guilabel:`Webshop` og aktivere "
"funktionen :guilabel:`Rabatter, loyalitet og gavekort`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:241
msgid ""
":ref:`Configure <sales/loyalty_discount/configure-programs>` the discount "
"program, make sure the :guilabel:`Website` option is enabled, and add the "
"relevant :ref:`Pricelist <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` "
"and :guilabel:`Website` on the program form, if needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:248
msgid "Permanent product discount"
msgstr "Permanent produktrabat"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:250
msgid ""
"When the price of a specific product is permanently reduced, the "
"strikethrough strategy is commonly used. This involves showing the new "
"discounted price, with the original price crossed out alongside it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:None
msgid "Price strikethrough."
msgstr "Gennemstreget pris."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:257
msgid ""
"To display a permanently discounted price, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to "
"the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section, enable the :guilabel:`Comparison Price` "
"option, and :guilabel:`Save`. Then :ref:`go to the product form <ecommerce/"
"products/product-creation>`, enter the new (discounted) price in "
"the :guilabel:`Sales Price` field, and the original price (strikethrough) in "
"the :guilabel:`Compare to Price` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:264
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Compare to Price` field must contain a price that is higher "
"than the :guilabel:`Sales Price` for the original price to appear with a "
"strikethrough."
msgstr ""
"Feltet :guilabel:`Sammenlign med pris` skal indeholde en pris, der er højere "
"end :guilabel:`Salgspris`, for at den oprindelige pris kan vises med en "
"gennemstregning."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:268
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Compare to Price` is not displayed if discounted pricelists "
"apply. If you want to use the :guilabel:`Compare to price` with another "
"discount, configure a pricelist with a :ref:`promotional code <ecommerce/"
"prices/promotional-code>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Sammenlign med pris` vises ikke, hvis nedsatte prislister gælder. "
"Hvis du vil bruge :guilabel:`Sammenlign med pris` sammen med en anden rabat, "
"skal du konfigurere en prisliste med en :ref:`kampagnekode <ecommerce/prices/"
"promotional-code>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:273
msgid "Discounted pricelists"
msgstr "Nedsatte prislister"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:275
msgid ""
"It is also possible to create :ref:`pricelists with discounts <sales/"
"products/price-rules>`. To do so, :ref:`create a pricelist <sales/products/"
"pricelist-configuration>` and :ref:`configure the discount <sales/products/"
"price-rules>`."
msgstr ""
"Det er også muligt at oprette :ref:`prislister med rabatter <sales/products/"
"price-rules>`. For at gøre dette skal du :ref:`oprette en prisliste <sales/"
"products/pricelist-configuration>` og :ref:`konfigurere rabatten <sales/"
"products/price-rules>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:279
msgid ""
"If a :ref:`pricelist <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` contains "
"a :ref:`Discount <sales/products/price-rules>` price type, the price is "
"striked through for applicable customers, even if the :ref:`Comparison Price "
"<ecommerce/prices/permanent-discounts>` feature has not been enabled."
msgstr ""
"Hvis en :ref:`prisliste <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` indeholder "
"en :ref:`Rabat <sales/products/price-rules>`-pristype, bliver prisen "
"overstreget for relevante kunder, selvom funktionen :ref:`Sammenligningspris "
"<ecommerce/prices/permanent-discounts>` ikke er blevet aktiveret."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:285
msgid ""
"If using pricelists with :ref:`country groups <ecommerce/prices/geoip>`, the "
"discounted pricelist must be assigned the same country group as the non-"
"discounted pricelist."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:291
msgid "E-commerce promotional code"
msgstr "Kampagnekode til webshop"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:293
msgid ""
"To offer a discounted pricelist for customers with a specific discount code, "
"access the relevant :ref:`pricelist form <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>`, go "
"to the :guilabel:`Ecommerce` tab, and add an :guilabel:`E-commerce "
"Promotional Code`, e.g., `SUMMERSALE10%`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:297
msgid ""
"Then, go to the :guilabel:`Rules` tab, click :guilabel:`Add a line`, "
"and :ref:`configure the discount <sales/products/price-rules>`. When a "
"customer enters the code during :ref:`checkout <ecommerce/checkout/"
"review_order>`, the discount is applied according to the configuration in "
"the :guilabel:`Rules` tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:303
msgid ""
"Make sure that the :ref:`Promo Code <ecommerce/checkout/review_order>` "
"option in the website editor is enabled and, if using :ref:`country groups "
"<ecommerce/prices/country-groups>`, that the discounted pricelist has the "
"same country group assigned as the non-discounted pricelist."
msgstr ""
"Sørg for, at :ref:`Kampagnekode <ecommerce/checkout/review_order>`-"
"indstillingen i hjemmesideeditoren er aktiveret, og hvis du "
"bruger :ref:`landegrupper <ecommerce/prices/country-groups>`, at den "
"nedsatte prisliste har samme landegruppe tildelt som den ikke-nedsatte "
"prisliste."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:310
msgid "Preventing direct sales and hiding prices"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:312
msgid ""
"Some businesses, such as :ref:`B2B shops <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/prices>` or "
"companies that sell luxury or custom items, may want to showcase their "
"products online while restricting direct purchases and hiding prices."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:316
msgid ""
"To control price visibility and prevent direct online sales on the e-"
"commerce site, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section, and "
"enable :guilabel:`Hide Add To Cart`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:320
msgid ""
"Then, select one of the following options from the :guilabel:`For` drop-down "
"list to define which products are affected:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:323
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`0 price products`: On the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/"
"products/product-creation>`, set the price to `0` for all desired products, "
"or create a :ref:`pricelist <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` where all product "
"prices are set to `0`. The price is then **not** displayed on "
"the :doc:`product page <../ecommerce_design/product_page>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:329
msgid ""
"Ensure the pricelist is assigned to the correct website and is listed first "
"among the website's pricelists."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:332
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Specific categories`: Select one or more "
"product :ref:`categories <ecommerce/categories_variants/categories>` from "
"the :guilabel:`Categories` drop-down menu that appears. At least one "
"category **must** be selected. The price is only displayed for products in "
"these categories if it is **not** `0`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:337
msgid ""
"Then, enter a redirect URL in the :guilabel:`Link URL` field. "
"The :guilabel:`Add to Cart` button on the :doc:`product page <../"
"ecommerce_design/product_page>` for zero-priced products or the selected "
"shop categories is then replaced by a default :guilabel:`Contact us` button, "
"which can be :ref:`customized <ecommerce/checkout/prevent-sale>` if needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:343
msgid ""
"Ensure no pricelist used on the e-commerce has been marked "
"as :guilabel:`Selectable` to prevent accidentally displaying the zero-priced "
"pricelist."
msgstr ""
"Sørg for, at ingen prisliste, der bruges på webshoppen, er markeret "
"som :guilabel:`Valgbar` for at undgå ved et uheld at vise prislisten med "
"nulpris."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:345
msgid ""
"To hide prices from public visitors while keeping them visible to logged-in "
"customers, create a zero-priced pricelist for non-logged-in customers "
"and :ref:`assign <sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-application>` a regular "
"pricelist (with actual prices) to customers with :doc:`portal access "
"<../../../general/users/user_portals/portal_access>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo eCommerce allows you to :ref:`create products <ecommerce/products/"
"product-creation>` and manage their :ref:`visibility <ecommerce/products/"
"publish-products>` on the website. Products can be :ref:`configured "
"<ecommerce/products/product-configuration>` in various ways, including "
"adding :ref:`product images and videos <ecommerce/products/images>`, "
"creating :ref:`product combinations <ecommerce/products/combos>`, "
"implementing :ref:`cross-selling and upselling strategies <ecommerce/"
"products/cross_upselling>`, attaching :ref:`digital files <ecommerce/"
"products/digital-files>`, :ref:`translating <ecommerce/products/"
"translation>` product information, :ref:`managing stock <ecommerce/products/"
"stock-management>`, and setting :ref:`packaging options <ecommerce/products/"
"stock-management/packagings>`."
msgstr ""

