#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:146
msgid "Google Tag Manager"
msgstr "Google Tag Manager"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:148
msgid ""
"Google Tag Manager is a tag management system that allows you to easily "
"update measurement codes and related code fragments, collectively known as "
"tags, on your website or mobile app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:152
msgid ""
":abbr:`GTM (Google Tag Manager)` is not an analytics tool and does not offer "
"reporting features. It is used to collect data and works alongside Google "
"Analytics to provide more detailed insights. To use GTM properly, it is "
"recommended to configure Google Analytics as well."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:156
msgid ""
"For more information, refer to the `documentation on linking Google "
"Analytics and Google Tag Manager <https://support.google.com/tagmanager/"
"answer/9442095?hl=en>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:160
msgid ""
"Some GTM tags use data layers (e.g., advanced eCommerce tracking data "
"layers) to retrieve variables and send them to Google Analytics. Data layers "
"are currently not managed in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Nogle GTM-tags bruger datalag (f.eks. avancerede webshop-sporingsdatalag) "
"til at hente variabler og sende dem til Google Analytics. Datalag håndteres "
"i øjeblikket ikke i Odoo."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:162
msgid ""
"Google Tag Manager may not be compliant with local data protection "
"regulations."
msgstr ""
"Google Tag Manager er muligvis ikke i overensstemmelse med lokale "
"databeskyttelsesregler."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:164
msgid "To configure GTM, proceed as follows:"
msgstr "For at konfigurere GTM skal du gøre følgende:"

